  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar on parliamentary representation for indigenous people, where representatives from indigenous groups, federal officials and from the russian parliament will participate. Russian counterpart is L&apos;auravetl&apos;an Indigenous information Center (IIC) in Moskva. Swedish counterpart is the Saami Council (Samer&#xE5;det).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarium f&#xF6;r urbefolkningar i Ryssland samt medlemmar av ryska parlamentet och federala ministrar som handl&#xE4;gger fr&#xE5;gor avseende urbefolkningar. Rysk samarbetspart &#xE4;r L&apos;auravetl&apos;an Indigenous information Center (IIC) i Moskva. Svensk genomf&#xF6;rande part &#xE4;r Samer&#xE5;det.</narrative>
  </description>
